```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String interfaceName = "eth0"; // nome da interface de rede a ser usada
        NetSniffer sniffer = new NetSniffer(interfaceName);
        Thread thread = new Thread(sniffer);
        thread.start();
    }
}
```
